# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
bin/*

# Go workspace file
go.work

# editor and IDE paraphernalia
.idea
.vscode
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Claude Code local state (transcripts, agent scratch, personal settings)
.claude/

# Working notes — implementation plans, checklists, exploratory designs.
docs/plans/
docs/design/

# Project-level Claude Code instructions (kept locally, not tracked).
CLAUDE.md

# Packaged chart artifacts produced by `helm package`.
dist/

# Cluster scenario scratch — hand-run manifests, not part of the chart tests.
hack/kv*
hack/eso*

# OS noise.
.DS_Store

# Build leftovers from before the operator moved out. Nothing produces them now
# and they are safe to delete; ignored so `git add -A` cannot commit them — the
# two manager binaries are 145 MB combined and permanent once pushed.
*.out
manager-linux-*-for-build
makefiles/
charts/mto-extension-openbao/

# ADRs. Never tracked in either repo — they live only in working trees. Copied
# to the operator checkout during the split; not a build artifact.
docs/adr/

# Compiled helper binaries — `go build ./hack/<helper>` drops these at the root.
/crd-validate
/render-validate
